SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 400 taxa with 3 partitions and 4975 total sites (0.136582% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	394	1510	766	352	869	869	5LTR+3LTR
   2	DNA	395	2878	729	288	2324	2324	gag_p19+gag_p24+gag_p15+pro_p14+pol_p95+env_gp46+env_gp21+px_p30+px_p13+px_p27+px_27+px_tax
   3	DNA	393	587	136	228	239	239	px_p12+px_p8+HBZ+HBZ_SI

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: TIM2+F+I+R2:5LTR+3LTR,TN+F+I+R2:gag_p19+gag_p24+gag_p15+pro_p14+pol_p95+env_gp46+env_gp21+px_p30+px_p13+px_p27+px_27+px_tax,GTR+F+G4:px_p12+px_p8+HBZ+HBZ_SI

List of best-fit models per partition:

  ID  Model                  LogL         AIC      w-AIC        AICc     w-AICc         BIC      w-BIC
   1  TIM2+F+I+R2      -10802.398   21624.797 + 8.73e-317   21624.943 + 1.19e-322   21677.995 + 1.26e-316
   2  TN+F+I+R2        -11136.171   22290.342 + 8.73e-317   22290.405 + 1.19e-322   22344.026 + 1.26e-316
   3  GTR+F+G4          -4509.755    9039.510 + 8.73e-317    9039.892 + 1.19e-322    9083.261 + 1.26e-316

AIC, w-AIC   : Akaike information criterion scores and weights.
AICc, w-AICc : Corrected AIC scores and weights.
BIC, w-BIC   : Bayesian information criterion scores and weights.

Plus signs denote the 95% confidence sets.
Minus signs denote significant exclusion.

SUBSTITUTION PROCESS
--------------------

Edge-linked-proportional partition model with separate substitution models and separate rates across sites

