   1  TIM2+F+I+R2    1.5749  TIM2{1.59866,16.0164,8.62079}+F{0.209825,0.339964,0.238849,0.211362}+I{0.319008}+R2{0.632396,1.06864,0.0485959,6.6712}
   2  TN+F+I+R2      0.5487  TN{15.2846,5.42764}+F{0.235535,0.333317,0.193792,0.237356}+I{0.610444}+R2{0.380304,2.10893,0.00925201,21.3968}
   3  GTR+F+G4       1.7340  GTR{0.62371,19.7034,1.31399,0.133433,4.95814}+F{0.144447,0.544553,0.110365,0.200635}+G4{4.77253}

